odotengine/godot/issues/102298","id":2629066467,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ctF7j","user":{"login":"Chaosus","id":3036176,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzYxNzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3036176?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus","html_url":"https://github.com/Chaosus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-01T18:46:54Z","updated_at":"2025-02-01T18:46:54Z","body":"Heh, I remember the time when @vnen said it is wrong idea: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/18143#issuecomment-570573808","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2629066467/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2629071394","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102298#issuecomment-2629071394","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102298","id":2629071394,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ctHIi","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-01T19:00:33Z","updated_at":"2025-02-01T19:00:33Z","body":"> Does this work correctly in SCU?\r\n\r\nVerified locally that it does work!\r\n\r\n> Heh, I remember the time when vnen said it is wrong idea: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/18143#issuecomment-570573808\r\n\r\nI understand the hesitation for adding non-standard functionality, but I can make an exception here for a few reasons:\r\n- `#pragma once` is ubiquitous to the point that it might as well be part of the standard\r\n- All of our tested buildsystems support `#pragma once`, so it's a non-blocker for our purposes\r\n- We're *already* using `#pragma once` in several third-party files. If strict-conformance was a concern, I imagine there'd be instances of developers opening issues to request the third-party code use header guards instead. Seeming as that has never been the case (to my knowledge), it's reasonable to conclude this isn't a real-world problem","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2629071394/reactions","total_count":7,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2631064014","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102298#issuecomment-2631064014","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102298","id":2631064014,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6c0tnO","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-03T13:51:27Z","updated_at":"2025-02-03T13:52:50Z","body":"> Does this work correctly in SCU?\r\n\r\nYeah it's fine I've been using `#pragma once` for years with SCU builds.\r\n\r\nI'm personally in favour of `#pragma once` BTW, I have a vague memory Juan wasn't convinced of need for change last time we discussed, but he may be fine with it if enough people in favour.\r\n\r\nAs we said last time:\r\n* It's available on all compilers these days (has been for decades I think we looked this up last time)\r\n* It makes one less think to screw up if there are duplicate defines in different files\r\n* Less verbose and less cognitive effort (particularly if you have other `#ifdef` sections, or namespaces)\r\n* It's one of the (few :smile: ) extensions to c++ MS got right\r\n* Easy to revert to `#ifdef` guards if a rare file needs to be given specialist treatment","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2631064014/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2634494961","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102298#issuecomment-2634494961","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102298","id":2634494961,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dBzPx","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-04T16:34:54Z","updated_at":"2025-02-04T16:34:54Z","body":"If explicit affirmation is necessary, then I'll echo that I'm very much in favor of this as well. In addition to the points lawnjelly already mentioned, it'll be MUCH less of a headache to enforce in terms of hooks/tools. The existing methods we have now are pretty hacky, because they have to account for the exact situations `#pragma once` avoid: duplicate names & unorthodox positioning.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2634494961/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2655195210","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102298#issuecomment-2655195210","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102298","id":2655195210,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6eQxBK","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-13T01:01:12Z","updated_at":"2025-02-13T01:01:12Z","body":"Just a thought, does this observably affect compile time?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2655195210/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app